  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Institute of Education of Brazil (IEB) project under Tropical Forest Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of th project is to protect Indigenous Lands (ILs) and promote their sustainable development in two regions (Southern Amazonas and Roraima) to conserve biodiversity, reduce poverty among its inhabitants, and mitigate the impacts of climate change on peoples and territories. The project has three primary action areas &#x2013; Territorial protection; Sustainable development; and Territorial management and climate adaptation &#x2013; each with its respective outcome and outputs.</narrative>
  </description>
